# Excluded from the .vsix.
#
# The card needs: src/ (the VS Code wiring), media/ (React + the runtime shim +
# the theme), and the parts of hud/ that the extension host imports or the
# webview loads — index.js, client.js, package.json, lib/ and every
# panels/<id>/host.js.
#
# Not needed at runtime, and each is large:
#   hud/client/            the bundle's FRAGMENTS (client.js is the built result)
#   hud/panels/*/client.js the same fragments, one per panel
#   hud/tools/             the vendor's test suite
#   test/, tools/          this port's own suites and build scripts
.vscode/**
.gitignore
.git/**
test/**
tools/**
hud/tools/**
hud/client/**
hud/panels/*/client.js
hud/panels/*/*.md
hud/*.tgz
node_modules/.cache/**
package-lock.json
*.vsix
*.log